{"id":"bad42cfb663ef0f3","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-time-hierarchy-notation.md","title":"73-thm-time-hierarchy-notation — time hierarchy notation","display":"73-thm-time-hierarchy-notation — time hierarchy notation","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-time-hierarchy-notation","display":"73-thm-time-hierarchy-notation — time hierarchy notation","depends_on":["[[73-df-time-complexity-notation]]","[[73-thm-multitape-time-hierarchy]]"],"aliases":["73-thm-time-hierarchy-notation","73-theorem-7.3"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-time-hierarchy-notation"},{"key":"display","html":"73-thm-time-hierarchy-notation — time hierarchy notation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"995085b8741b47ae\" href=\"?note=995085b8741b47ae\" title=\"73-df-time-complexity-notation\">73-df-time-complexity-notation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dfb238ddf618b68f\" href=\"?note=dfb238ddf618b68f\" title=\"73-thm-multitape-time-hierarchy\">73-thm-multitape-time-hierarchy</a></span></div>"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-time-hierarchy-notation</span><span>73-theorem-7.3</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(f,g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TimeConstr},\\mathrm{TIME}\">\\(\\mathrm{TimeConstr},\\mathrm{TIME}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"995085b8741b47ae\" href=\"?note=995085b8741b47ae\" title=\"73-df-time-complexity-notation\">73-df-time-complexity-notation</a>，两者均使用同一资源机上下文。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"o\">\\(o\\)</span> 比较在断言中展开为正有理精度的全称条件，不把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 作为类参数中的游离变量。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}7.3}\\vdash\nf,g\\in\\mathrm{TimeConstr}\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists n_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\{m\\in\\mathbb N:m\\ge n_0\\}\\;\nbf(n)\\lceil\\log_2(f(n)+1)\\rceil\\le ag(n)\\bigr)\n\\to\\mathrm{TIME}(f)\\subsetneq\\mathrm{TIME}(g)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}7.3}\\vdash\nf,g\\in\\mathrm{TimeConstr}\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists n_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\{m\\in\\mathbb N:m\\ge n_0\\}\\;\nbf(n)\\lceil\\log_2(f(n)+1)\\rceil\\le ag(n)\\bigr)\n\\to\\mathrm{TIME}(f)\\subsetneq\\mathrm{TIME}(g)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条目保留原调用记号；参数与类型由 Hypothesis 固定，Assertion 给出完整定义或结论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-time-complexity-notation","status":"resolved","id":"995085b8741b47ae","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-time-complexity-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-multitape-time-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"dfb238ddf618b68f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-multitape-time-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-time-complexity-notation","status":"resolved","id":"995085b8741b47ae","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f,g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{>0}$；$\\mathrm{TimeConstr},\\mathrm{TIME}$ 见 [[73-df-time-complexity-notation]]，两者均使用同一资源机上下文。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f,g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TimeConstr},\\mathrm{TIME}","display":false},{"tex":"o","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}7.3}\\vdash\nf,g\\in\\mathrm{TimeConstr}\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\;\\exists n_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\{m\\in\\mathbb N:m\\ge n_0\\}\\;\nbf(n)\\lceil\\log_2(f(n)+1)\\rceil\\le ag(n)\\bigr)\n\\to\\mathrm{TIME}(f)\\subsetneq\\mathrm{TIME}(g)","display":true}],"bytes":1118,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["995085b8741b47ae","dfb238ddf618b68f"]}